(3833, '「私はお金で幸せは買えると思います。私は花火を見ていると幸せな気持ちになるからです。もし私が大金持ちだったら、毎日花火を楽しんでずっと幸せな気持ちでいられることができます。」彼女は幸せそうな口調でそう言った。', '"I think money can buy happiness because watching fireworks makes me happy. If I had a lot of money, I could enjoy fireworks every day and feel happy all the time," she said happily.', 16, '{"Ja": "「私はお金で幸せは買えると思います。私は花火を見ていると幸せな気持ちになるからです。もし私が大金持ちだったら、毎日花火を楽しんでずっと幸せな気持ちでいられることができます。」彼女は幸せそうな口調でそう言った。", "En": "\"I think money can buy happiness because watching fireworks makes me happy. If I had a lot of money, I could enjoy fireworks every day and feel happy all the time,\" she said happily.", "Level": 16, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 3833, "Characters": "幸せ"}, {"SubjectId": 3714, "Characters": "私"}, {"SubjectId": 2797, "Characters": "金"}, {"SubjectId": 3054, "Characters": "買う"}, {"SubjectId": 2914, "Characters": "思う"}, {"SubjectId": 2695, "Characters": "花火"}, {"SubjectId": 2697, "Characters": "見る"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 3132, "Characters": "気持ち"}, {"SubjectId": 3252, "Characters": "成る"}, {"SubjectId": 3131, "Characters": "金持ち"}, {"SubjectId": 2759, "Characters": "毎日"}, {"SubjectId": 3491, "Characters": "楽しむ"}, {"SubjectId": 3082, "Characters": "事"}, {"SubjectId": 3418, "Characters": "出来る"}, {"SubjectId": 6030, "Characters": "彼女"}, {"SubjectId": 7685, "Characters": "口調"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 923, "Characters": "私"}, {"SubjectId": 602, "Characters": "金"}, {"SubjectId": 969, "Characters": "幸"}, {"SubjectId": 699, "Characters": "買"}, {"SubjectId": 637, "Characters": "思"}, {"SubjectId": 557, "Characters": "花"}, {"SubjectId": 480, "Characters": "火"}, {"SubjectId": 558, "Characters": "見"}, {"SubjectId": 548, "Characters": "気"}, {"SubjectId": 727, "Characters": "持"}, {"SubjectId": 453, "Characters": "大"}, {"SubjectId": 572, "Characters": "毎"}, {"SubjectId": 476, "Characters": "日"}, {"SubjectId": 704, "Characters": "楽"}, {"SubjectId": 1594, "Characters": "彼"}, {"Sub