(7586, '多くのコアラはコアラレトロウィルスというウイルスを先天的に保持しており、ストレスなどを受けると、死につながることがあります。ですので、動物園では、カメラのフラッシュや大声を出すなどしないよう、十分気をつけてください。', 'Many koalas congenitally carry a virus called the koala retrovirus, and when they experience stress, it can lead to fatal consequences. Therefore, in zoos, please be careful not to use camera flashes or raise your voice excessively.', 16, '{"Ja": "多くのコアラはコアラレトロウィルスというウイルスを先天的に保持しており、ストレスなどを受けると、死につながることがあります。ですので、動物園では、カメラのフラッシュや大声を出すなどしないよう、十分気をつけてください。", "En": "Many koalas congenitally carry a virus called the koala retrovirus, and when they experience stress, it can lead to fatal consequences. Therefore, in zoos, please be careful not to use camera flashes or raise your voice excessively.", "Level": 16, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 7586, "Characters": "動物園"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}, {"SubjectId": 3803, "Characters": "保持"}, {"SubjectId": 7497, "Characters": "保持する"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 3091, "Characters": "受ける"}, {"SubjectId": 7525, "Characters": "死"}, {"SubjectId": 9247, "Characters": "繋がる"}, {"SubjectId": 3082, "Characters": "事"}, {"SubjectId": 2868, "Characters": "有る"}, {"SubjectId": 3353, "Characters": "動物"}, {"SubjectId": 2815, "Characters": "大声"}, {"SubjectId": 2556, "Characters": "出す"}, {"SubjectId": 9180, "Characters": "する"}, {"SubjectId": 9282, "Characters": "十分"}, {"SubjectId": 2670, "Characters": "気"}, {"SubjectId": 2937, "Characters": "付ける"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 570, "Characters": "多"}, {"SubjectId": 543, "Characters": "先"}, {"SubjectId": 473, "Characters": "天"}, {"SubjectId": 914, "Characters": "的"}, {"SubjectId": 983, "Characters": "保"}, {"SubjectId": 727, "Characters": "持"}, {"SubjectId": 711, "Characters": "受"}, {"SubjectId": 617, "Characters": "死"}, {"SubjectId": 827, "Characters": "動"}, {"SubjectId": 718, "Characters": "物"}, {"SubjectId": 960, "Characters": "園"}, {"SubjectId": 453, "Characters": "大"}, {"SubjectId": 586, "Characters": "声"}, {"SubjectId": 483