(3976, '小学生の時、初めて仲良くなった子の母親に名前を言うと、顔色が変わった。それ以後、その子は急に私とつるまなくなった。当時八才だったが、全て察した。', 'When I was in elementary school, I told my name to the mother of the first friend I ever made, and her expression changed. After that, the child suddenly stopped hanging out with me. I was eight at the time, but I understood everything.', 17, '{"Ja": "小学生の時、初めて仲良くなった子の母親に名前を言うと、顔色が変わった。それ以後、その子は急に私とつるまなくなった。当時八才だったが、全て察した。", "En": "When I was in elementary school, I told my name to the mother of the first friend I ever made, and her expression changed. After that, the child suddenly stopped hanging out with me. I was eight at the time, but I understood everything.", "Level": 17, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 3976, "Characters": "察する"}, {"SubjectId": 3449, "Characters": "小学生"}, {"SubjectId": 2958, "Characters": "時"}, {"SubjectId": 3569, "Characters": "初めて"}, {"SubjectId": 3312, "Characters": "仲良く"}, {"SubjectId": 3252, "Characters": "成る"}, {"SubjectId": 2513, "Characters": "子"}, {"SubjectId": 3552, "Characters": "母親"}, {"SubjectId": 3460, "Characters": "名前"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}, {"SubjectId": 7588, "Characters": "変わる"}, {"SubjectId": 9192, "Characters": "それ"}, {"SubjectId": 8801, "Characters": "以後"}, {"SubjectId": 9205, "Characters": "その"}, {"SubjectId": 7545, "Characters": "急"}, {"SubjectId": 3714, "Characters": "私"}, {"SubjectId": 2482, "Characters": "八"}, {"SubjectId": 2854, "Characters": "全て"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 463, "Characters": "小"}, {"SubjectId": 599, "Characters": "学"}, {"SubjectId": 850, "Characters": "生"}, {"SubjectId": 662, "Characters": "時"}, {"SubjectId": 784, "Characters": "初"}, {"SubjectId": 776, "Characters": "仲"}, {"SubjectId": 805, "Characters": "良"}, {"SubjectId": 462, "Characters": "子"}, {"SubjectId": 524, "Characters": "母"}, {"SubjectId": 770, "Characters": "親"}, {"SubjectId": 544, "Characters": "名"}, {"SubjectId": 633, "Characters": "前"}, {"SubjectId": 593, "Characters": "言"}, {"SubjectId": 772, "Characters": "顔"}, {"Su